<title>USA: PECO sets Limerick 2 refuling outage.</title>
<headline>PECO sets Limerick 2 refuling outage.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PECO Energy Co said Thursday Unit 2 at Limerick Generating Station in Montgomery County, Pa., was taken offline Thursday afternoon for a 25-day refueling and maintenance outage.</p>
<p>The last outage at the 1,055 megawatt plant took 22.8 days, which was then a world record for large commercial nuclear plants, PECO said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
